WEBVTT

00:00.450 --> 00:03.300
Your bank already texts you every time you spend.

00:04.600 --> 00:06.600
Penny reads it, right on your phone.

00:07.650 --> 00:09.000
And it's in your budget.

00:09.300 --> 00:10.500
You typed nothing.

00:10.650 --> 00:11.550
It can look.

00:11.600 --> 00:14.100
It can't touch. It never moves money.

00:14.300 --> 00:16.000
Your data stays on your phone.

00:16.100 --> 00:18.400
And nothing saves until you confirm.

00:19.250 --> 00:21.200
Penny. Join the waitlist.
